<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Status Pengajuan Cuti</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Google Sans', Roboto, Segoe UI, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            color: #3c4043;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        .card {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #dadce0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(60,64,67,.30), 0 1px 3px 1px rgba(60,64,67,.15);
        }
        .logo {
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            width: 125px;
            height: auto;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #202124;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 400;
            line-height: 32px;
            margin: 0 0 16px;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 21px;
            margin: 0 0 20px;
        }
        .detail-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 16px 0 24px;
        }
        .detail-table td {
            padding: 8px 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 21px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f3f4;
        }
        .detail-table td:first-child {
            color: #70757a;
            width: 45%;
        }
        .detail-table td:last-child {
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #202124;
        }
        .notice-box {
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }
        .notice-box.approved {
            background-color: #e6f4ea;
            border: 1px solid #81c995;
        }
        .notice-box.rejected {
            background-color: #fce8e6;
            border: 1px solid #f28b82;
        }
        .notice-box p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #3c4043;
        }
        .status-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .status-badge.approved {
            background-color: #e6f4ea;
            color: #137333;
        }
        .status-badge.rejected {
            background-color: #fce8e6;
            color: #c5221f;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 32px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #70757a;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background-color: #dadce0;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://timemoz.com/logo.png" alt="Timemoz Logo" class="logo">

            <p>Halo <strong>{{employeeName}}</strong>,</p>
            <p>Pengajuan cuti Anda telah
                {{#if isApproved}}
                    <span class="status-badge approved">Disetujui</span>
                {{else}}
                    <span class="status-badge rejected">Ditolak</span>
                {{/if}}
                oleh {{reviewerName}}.
            </p>

            <table class="detail-table">
                <tr><td>Jenis cuti</td><td>{{leaveTypeName}}</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Dari tanggal</td><td>{{startDate}}{{#if startDayLabel}} ({{startDayLabel}}){{/if}}</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Sampai tanggal</td><td>{{endDate}}{{#if endDayLabel}} ({{endDayLabel}}){{/if}}</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Total hari cuti</td><td>{{totalDays}} hari</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Alasan pengajuan</td><td>{{reason}}</td></tr>
            </table>

            {{#if isApproved}}
            <div class="notice-box approved">
                <p>Cuti Anda sudah disetujui. File kalender (.ics) terlampir pada email ini; buka untuk menambahkannya ke kalender Anda.</p>
                {{#if approvalNote}}<p style="margin-top: 8px;"><strong>Catatan approver:</strong> {{approvalNote}}</p>{{/if}}
            </div>
            {{else}}
            <div class="notice-box rejected">
                <p>Mohon maaf, pengajuan cuti Anda tidak disetujui.</p>
                <p style="margin-top: 8px;"><strong>Alasan penolakan:</strong> {{rejectionReason}}</p>
            </div>
            {{/if}}

            <div class="divider"></div>
            <p style="margin: 0;">Jika ada pertanyaan, silakan hubungi approver Anda.</p>
            <br />
            <p style="margin: 0;">Salam,<br /><strong>Timemoz</strong></p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 12px;">Jl. Mampang Prapatan Raya no 17c, Mampang Prapatan, Jakarta Selatan, Indonesia, 12790</p>
            <p style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 12px;">&copy; 2026 Timemoz, Jakarta, Indonesia</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
